    {
      "id": "claim_42fa16a78dc9436289b12e99590ca44e",
      "statement": "`pushChangesToBranch` returns `{ success: true, pushFailed: true }` when `git push` fails with `Permission` / `access_denied` / `403` in stderr, so the local commit is preserved while the caller learns the push did not land on the remote.",
