    {
      "id": "claim_5bf1ccc5054644d2aad95d487e9e2edf",
      "statement": "Vite projects (detected via `dependencies.vite` or `devDependencies.vite`) auto-bind dev server port 5173 and receive a sed-based patch to `vite.config.js` that sets `server.host: true`; the patched file is added to `~/.gitignore_global` so the change never gets committed.",
