    {
      "id": "claim_d08764447e5e49158a9b967ccd467def",
      "statement": "`POST /api/tasks/:taskId/start-sandbox` rejects with `400 'Keep-alive is not enabled for this task'` when `task.keepAlive` is false; it probes any existing `sandboxId`/`sandboxUrl` with `Sandbox.get + echo test` and clears them from the DB if unreachable before creating a fresh sandbox.",
