    {
      "id": "claim_72dc97ed69d8412db238ed1411cf10d7",
      "statement": "`shutdownSandbox(sandbox)` from `lib/sandbox/git.ts` does not invoke the SDK's `sandbox.stop()` — it is best-effort `pkill -f` of `node`/`python`/`npm`/`yarn`/`pnpm`, then returns success; actual sandbox garbage collection relies on the SDK timeout, per the function's own comment.",
      "evidence": [
